  <Lines>k__BackingField:
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "Et ensuite, comme il \xE9tait en train d\u2019inventer je ne sais quoi sur
      moi, je lui ai fait fermer sa bouche en utilisant la mani\xE8re forte.\r\n"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4db0d9531338cfe4ea4e57a3339c89c1, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3973df86522e4b743879172e3518e737, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "J\u2019ai essay\xE9 de me d\xE9fendre, mais elle est devenue compl\xE8tement
      folle !"
  - <Npc>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d57cec67bb2a1a945ada3b66d3cb9bf5, type: 2}
    <Expression>k__BackingField: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 15a032d1f64921b49a6cec6c0a26887d, type: 2}
    <Text>k__BackingField:
    - "T\u2019aurais m\xEAme pas pu te d\xE9fendre."
